@base = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create a critical, aging claim
POST {{base}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "CLM-DEMO-001",
  "policyNumber": "POL-2026-44",
  "severity": 4,
  "exposure": 92000,
  "reportedAt": "2026-09-10T12:00:00Z",
  "assignedAdjuster": "Maya"
}

### Ranked queue
GET {{base}}/api/claims

### Why is this claim urgent?
GET {{base}}/api/claims/CLM-DEMO-001/explain

### Move into investigation
POST {{base}}/api/claims/CLM-DEMO-001/transition
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1
}

### Audit trail
GET {{base}}/api/claims/CLM-DEMO-001/audit
